      streak: (g, n) => `Another ${g}, darling? That's ${n} in a row. I'm not judging. I'm taking notes.`, huge: (t, p) => `${p} pages? ${t} is a commitment, darling. I like a reader who commits.`, stalled: (t, d, p) => `${t} has been waiting ${d} days at ${p}%, darling. Even I don't keep anyone waiting that long.`,
